[{:db/id -1, :adr/id "adr-2607171600-docs-adr-edn-only-datascript", :adr/title "ADR-2607171600: docs/ADR は EDN のみ — DataScript/datom query が正経路", :adr/status "accepted", :adr/doc_type "adr", :adr/topic "docs-edn-only", :adr/date "2026-07-17", :adr/last_verified "2026-07-17", :adr/source-format "edn", :adr/authoritative true, :adr/deciders ["Jun Kawasaki"], :adr/authoritative_for ["90-docs EDN-only SSoT" "DataScript query path" "docs-edn-only verify" "BMC .edn projections"], :adr/related ["manifest/edn-datomize.cljs" "manifest/edn-query.cljs" "manifest/docs-edn-only.cljs" "manifest/schema.edn" "90-docs/adr/2607021500-portfolio-bmc-lean.datoms.edn"], :adr/supersedes [], :adr/superseded_by [], :adr/problem "docs/ADR が md と edn の二重管理になり DataScript 横断 query ができない。md を正本とみなし edn を投影扱いする運用は再発の温床。", :adr/decision "90-docs の正本は EDN のみ。md は正本でも生成物でもない。.edn が唯一の book of record。最初から edn を書く。", :adr/consequences ["90-docs に .md を置かない" "ADR は .edn で読み書き" "横断検索は datalog" "source-format は edn" "path 参照は .edn"], :adr/body "# ADR-2607171600: docs/ADR は EDN のみ — DataScript/datom query が正経路\n\n## Status\naccepted — 2026-07-17\n\n## Decision (normative)\n1. EDN is the sole SSoT for 90-docs/ (especially adr/). No .md files.\n2. Do not treat EDN as a projection of markdown. Author EDN tx-data from day one.\n3. Shape: [{:db/id -1 :adr/id ...}].\n4. Nested maps/vectors: pr-str string blobs.\n5. Query: nbb --classpath \".:scripts/nbb_compat\" manifest/edn-query.cljs\n6. Verify: nbb --classpath \".:scripts/nbb_compat\" manifest/docs-edn-only.cljs verify\n7. BMC projections write .edn only.\n8. Multi-entity *.datoms.edn catalogs stay multi-entity.\n"}]
